  "$|A\\times B|={@0}\\cdot {@1}={@2}$, preto $|\\mathcal{P}(A\\times B)|=2^{{@3}}={@4}$.": "$|A\\times B|={@0}\\cdot {@1}={@2}$이므로 $|\\mathcal{P}(A\\times B)|=2^{{@3}}={@4}$예요.",
